 will link to::
 
+    file:///usr/share/doc/postgresql-doc-16/html/libpq-misc.html #LIBPQ-PQLIBVERSION
+previously to:
     https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/libpq-misc.html #LIBPQ-PQLIBVERSION
 
 """
